{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"1502","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"電力排碳係數創新低 每度電排碳0.495公斤","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">時間：2023-06-21 19:57 新聞引據：中央社 撰稿編輯：李自立</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/111%E9%9B%BB%E5%8A%9B%E7%A2%B3%E6%8E%92%E4%BF%82%E6%95%B8.png\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部21日公布2022年電力排碳係數為0.495，為94年有統計以來最低。(圖:經濟部能源局)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 0px; height: 1px; margin: 20px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部今天(21日)公布2022年電力排碳係數為0.495，為94年有統計以來最低。能源局表示，電力排碳係數走低是包括計算公式修正、去年發電量下降、台電近年大力減碳等3大原因所致。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">電力排碳係數是指台電、民營電廠、汽電共生業發電所耗用的燃料，除以總發電量，進而計算每發一度電所排放的二氧化碳量。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">據能源局統計，2017至2020年電力排碳係數分別為0.554、0.533、0.509及0.502，呈現逐年下降趨勢；但在2021年回升至0.509，原因是用電量較2020年增加96.48億度，為確保穩定供電，增加火力發電。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部今天公布2022年電力排碳係數為0.495，首度降至0.5以下，也是94年有統計以來最低數據。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部官員表示，此次計算公式修正，焚化爐排碳不納入電力項目，加上去年總體用電量減少1.3%，發電隨之調降，以及台電近年力推再生能源、增氣減煤等政策獲得成效等3大原因所致。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部表示，電力排碳係數受到總用電量及能源配比影響，台電要降低電力排碳係數，除了持續推動無碳排的光電、風電等再生能源，另一途徑就是推動「增氣減煤」，以及鼓勵產業、民眾節電。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\">資料來源:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://www.rti.org.tw/news/view/id/2171468\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(197, 224, 180); text-decoration-line: none; outline: 0px !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">https://www.rti.org.tw/news/view/id/2171468</span></a></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2023-06-28","clk_count":"18"}},"__N_SSG":true}